{
  "_comment": [
    "BIGANN 1M sweep. Grid deliberately TRIMMED vs the 100k sweep: at 1M each",
    "merged index is ~650 MB and nothing deletes them, so 32 runs would leave",
    "~20 GB of orphaned graphs. What matters here is the SCALE TREND, which needs",
    "the SAME parameter points as 100k - not new exploration. Configs carried",
    "forward: IGTM j5,l7 / CGTM j15,l5 / NGM sef10+sef20 / HNSWMerger lam1-20 /",
    "SIGM / INSERT, across ef_construction 200-64-32.",
    "Dropped vs 100k: the IGTM/CGTM parameter exploration (j20,l5 / j64,l5 /",
    "defaults) and the M=32 point - both answered at 100k.",
    "Disk: ~17 merge runs x ~650 MB ~= 11 GB, plus ~3.5 GB of leaves.",
    "Run `rm -f .work_bigann1m/merged_*.hnsw` when the rows are in the JSONL."
  ],
  "binaries": {
    "builds": "$HNSWMERGER_BIN/builds",
    "exps": "$HNSWMERGER_BIN/exps"
  },
  "dataset": {
    "name": "bigann1m",
    "dim": 128,
    "nb": 1000000,
    "base": "data/sift_scales/sift1m_base.fvecs",
    "query": "data/sift_scales/sift_query.fvecs",
    "groundtruth": "data/sift_scales/sift1m_gt.ivecs"
  },
  "hnsw": {
    "M": 16,
    "ef_construction": 200
  },
  "eval": {
    "k": 10,
    "kk": 100,
    "nq": 10000,
    "efs_array": [
      10,
      50,
      100,
      200,
      400
    ]
  },
  "threads": 1,
  "workdir": ".work_bigann1m",
  "results_path": "results/bigann1m.jsonl",
  "sweep": [
    {
      "_block": "efc=200 - the group where HNSWMerger beat monolithic at 100k",
      "algo": [
        "IGTM"
      ],
      "n_parts": [
        2
      ],
      "order": [
        "balanced"
      ],
      "params": [
        {
          "jump_ef": 5,
          "local_ef": 7,
          "next_step_k": 3,
          "next_step_ef": 3,
          "search_M": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "algo": [
        "CGTM"
      ],
      "n_parts": [
        2
      ],
      "order": [
        "balanced"
      ],
      "params": [
        {
          "jump_ef": 15,
          "local_ef": 5,
          "next_step_k": 3,
          "search_M": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "algo": [
        "NGM"
      ],
      "n_parts": [
        2
      ],
      "order": [
        "balanced"
      ],
      "params": [
        {
          "search_ef": 10
        },
        {
          "search_ef": 20
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "algo": [
        "TWO_MERGE"
      ],
      "n_parts": [
        2
      ],
      "order": [
        "balanced"
      ],
      "params": [
        {
          "merge_lambda": 1
        },
        {
          "merge_lambda": 4
        },
        {
          "merge_lambda": 10
        },
        {
          "merge_lambda": 20
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "algo": [
        "SIGM"
      ],
      "n_parts": [
        2
      ],
      "order": [
        "balanced"
      ],
      "params": [
        {
          "merge_ef_construction": -1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "algo": [
        "INSERT"
      ],
      "n_parts": [
        1
      ],
      "order": [
        "balanced"
      ],
      "params": [
        {}
      ]
    },
    {
      "_block": "ef_construction axis - does the crossover survive a cheaper build?",
      "algo": [
        "IGTM"
      ],
      "n_parts": [
        2
      ],
      "order": [
        "balanced"
      ],
      "params": [
        {
          "ef_construction": 64,
          "jump_ef": 5,
          "local_ef": 7,
          "next_step_k": 3,
          "next_step_ef": 3,
          "search_M": 5
        },
        {
          "ef_construction": 32,
          "jump_ef": 5,
          "local_ef": 7,
          "next_step_k": 3,
          "next_step_ef": 3,
          "search_M": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "algo": [
        "CGTM"
      ],
      "n_parts": [
        2
      ],
      "order": [
        "balanced"
      ],
      "params": [
        {
          "ef_construction": 64,
          "jump_ef": 15,
          "local_ef": 5,
          "next_step_k": 3,
          "search_M": 5
        },
        {
          "ef_construction": 32,
          "jump_ef": 15,
          "local_ef": 5,
          "next_step_k": 3,
          "search_M": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "algo": [
        "TWO_MERGE"
      ],
      "n_parts": [
        2
      ],
      "order": [
        "balanced"
      ],
      "params": [
        {
          "ef_construction": 64,
          "merge_lambda": 4
        },
        {
          "ef_construction": 32,
          "merge_lambda": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "algo": [
        "SIGM"
      ],
      "n_parts": [
        2
      ],
      "order": [
        "balanced"
      ],
      "params": [
        {
          "ef_construction": 64,
          "merge_ef_construction": -1
        },
        {
          "ef_construction": 32,
          "merge_ef_construction": -1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "algo": [
        "INSERT"
      ],
      "n_parts": [
        1
      ],
      "order": [
        "balanced"
      ],
      "params": [
        {
          "ef_construction": 64
        },
        {
          "ef_construction": 32
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}